  "prefLabel": "Elec 401.01 Renewal of License",
  "priorExpiration": "2013-12-03",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Elec 401.01 Renewal of License. The following license types shall be renewed 2 years from the date of issuance, along with the fee described in Plc 1002.13:\n\n(a) Master electricians;\n\n(b) Journeyman electrician;\n\n(c) High/medium voltage electrician; and\n\n(d) Corporate or partnership.\n\nSource. #10356, INTERIM, eff 6-6-13, EXPIRES: 12-3-13 (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Elec 300); ss by #10420, eff 9-25-13 (from Elec 305.04); ss by #13898, eff 5-4-24",
